{"version":1,"key":"quest:88","content":{"id":88,"title":"mask-image 的作用是什么？如何使用？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:88","type":"quest","id":88},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"mask 实现元素局部透明与渐变遮罩","meta":"","excerpt":"在 CSS 中，如果想让元素的某些部分呈现不同程度的透明，opacity 是做不到的，它只能对整个元素统一设置透明度。mask 就是为了解决这个问题，它可以根据参考图像的亮度或透明度，给元素的不同区域施加不同的透明效果。 mask 的属性体系和 background 特别相似，mask-image、mask-posit","target":{"key":"card:747","type":"card","id":747},"citeKey":"card:747"}],"trail":[{"time":1758530107307,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1780309143670,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1780311327824,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"createTime":1758530107307,"updateTime":1758530107307,"resolvedTime":1780311327824},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1758530107307}}